Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:44:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Update ffmpeg to 9.1

Drop the yuv2rgb odd width patch, which is part of 9.1, and the Windows
zlib patch, as configure now picks z.lib or zlib.lib by itself. Refresh
the Windows libdav1d patch for the new libcurl check in configure.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream: https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/pull/30674

Signed-off-by: Bernd Kuhls <bernd@kuhls.net>
